	"Name": "Total Rehaul",
	"Author": "BrutalCleric",
	"TagLine": "Tons of new furniture items.",
	"Description": "Tons of new furniture options. Works with Custom Furniture. I have separated into 4 different files, so you can pick and choose what you want to use. Must have **Custom Furniture** installed.\n\nMain File: **Total Rehaul**-\n16 new Dining Chairs\n4 new Benches\n6 new Arm Chairs\n7 new Couches\n5 new Dressers\n1 Coffee Table\n3 New Dining Tables\n2 Desks\n1 Picnic Table\n2 China Cabinets\n2 Bookshelves\n7 Side Tables\n2 Lamps\n1 Kitchen Counter perfect for that empty spot in the upgraded kitchen\nand various Decorative items.\n\nOptional File 1: **Total Rehaul.Rugs**\n\nAdds 22 new Rug options.\n\nOptional File 2: **Total Rehaul.Toys**\n\nAdds 80+ Kids Toys\n\nOptional File 3: **Total Rehaul.Art**\n\nAdds 25 Classic Paintings, 2 Day of the Dead Skeleton Masks, 2 Egyptian Cat Statues, and a couple of Tribal Masks\n\nSpecial shout out to the **Sundrop City** team( [Sundrop City at Stardew Valley Nexus - Mods and community](https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/4014))-\n\nThey have graciously allowed me to use some furniture items in this mod\n\nWhite Egg Chair\nOrange U-Shaped Chair\nOrange U-Shaped Couch\nBBQ (by **ChefRude**)\nRattan Chair and Side Table\nOrange Potted Plant\nBlue Vase\nWhite and Orange Potted Plant and\nYellow Vase.\n\nFYI, This is only the 2nd Mod I've ever made so please be understanding. Will try my best to help anyone that has an issue but It may be a case of the blind leading the blind.  If you comment in comments tab, I may not answer immediately. Kids, spouse, job and all manner of real life, keeps me pretty busy. Hope you enjoy.",
